{"id": "EUVD-2026-102964", "enisaUuid": "168c9c5b-f81a-35d2-a935-749cb1ed94fd", "description": "IceCMS through 4.1.5 contains a missing authentication vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to modify, delete, or disable any account because /User/** is excluded from the Shiro jwt filter. Attackers can send PUT requests to /User/updateUser to set a new password and role on any userId, including administrators, enabling full account takeover.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:53:09", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/icecms-backend-user-admin-unauth-account-takeover", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS/blob/afd7a9f0d04a714e7c7e735e566c27f54b5d5201/IceCMS-ment/src/main/java/com/ttice/icewkment/controller/backend/UserController.java#L743-L818", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS/blob/afd7a9f0d04a714e7c7e735e566c27f54b5d5201/IceCMS-ment/src/main/java/com/ttice/icewkment/configuration/ShiroConfig.java#L64-L88", "https://github.com/Thecosy/IceCMS", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/icecms-through-4.1.5-missing-authentication-via-user-administrative-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rgvr-v3r8-5gwx", "CVE-2026-111673"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.55, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "490ebb0e-5d83-3a04-a72c-95f120583a19", "product": {"name": "IceCMS", "vendor": {"name": "Thecosy"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.1.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8609f5d7-6490-3171-acdf-bc8dc7d661db", "vendor": {"name": "Thecosy"}}], "isExploited": false}